  "description": {
    "en": "Tecnifibre Razor Spin is a square-shaped co-polyester monofilament string designed for maximum spin and directional control. High modulus co-polyester provides excellent precision, while polyurethane additives improve comfort compared with traditional polyester strings. The square profile increases ball bite for enhanced topspin without sacrificing feel.",

    "zh": "Tecnifibre Razor Spin 是一款方形截面的高模量共聚酯单丝球线，专为追求旋转与控制的球员打造。高模量 Co-Poly 提供精准击球反馈，PU 聚氨酯添加剂则改善传统聚酯线偏硬的手感，提高舒适度。方形截面能够更有效咬住网球，提升上旋制造能力，同时保持稳定的方向控制。"
  },

